  (text "One board for both dryers, every part assembled by JLCPCB. The 1-roll BOM leaves off the 2-roll-only parts (field Build)."
    (at 260 330.2 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "028dace3-78e9-429d-a5ea-966f18a4931b"))
  (text "U1 antenna at the board edge: no copper, parts or traces under it. USB is data only: plug in 12 V while flashing."
    (at 260 336.2 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "0b0ece25-c866-483d-b509-67859a238769"))
  (text "SB1 (U14, C37, J18) and SB2 (U15, C39, J19) are small boards on break-off tabs: their nets (SB1_*, SB2_*) reach the board only through the harness."
    (at 260 342.2 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "645c6b98-cc7b-4696-8026-208519d0c870"))
  (text "U10/U11: 39k/10k on VREF = 1.0 V -> about 0.72 A RMS with 0.11 R sense resistors. Exposed pad to GND with vias."
    (at 260 348.2 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "b51ee0e6-b99e-4174-885b-93e0e83cc88b"))
  (text "Heater path J1 -> F1 -> TB2 -> Q1 carries 12.5 A: wide pours, 2 oz copper, copper area under Q1."
